Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 12:20:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add a filter to drop FontForge AltUni alternate codepoints

--drop-alternate-unicodes drops the plain AltUni2 alternates and keeps each
glyph's Encoding codepoint, for a cmap that does not carry the alternates
(FontForge's own export maps them). Variation sequences are untouched.

Assisted by AI agents (Claude Opus 5, Claude Opus 5.5)
